l,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon 780M (radeonsi, phoenix, LLVM 20.1.2, DRM 3.61, 6.14.0-37-generic) - AMD Ryzen 9 7940HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 14.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm using the \"English (US, Intl., with dead keys)\" keyboard layout, that inserts a diaeresis ([wikipedia](https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/◌̈)) when pressing the quotation mark key, and replaces it with a quotation mark if you then press the space bar ( or replaces it with ë, ä, etc. if you press one of those keys), but the godot code editor completely freezes for that specific file as soon as I enter the diaeresis and fixes itself as soon as in restart the editor (which makes it hard to make an MRP for this issue)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- use a keyboard layout that inserts a diaeresis when pressing the quotation mark ( I use \"English (US, Intl., with dead keys)\"\n- try to type a quotation mark\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI cant get the issue to show up when loading from a file, only when typing, so the issue will probably not show up in this MRP unless you're also using a keyboard layout that does this and try to type a quotation mark.\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24723138/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https: